# 📄 `OPIc/SampleAnswers/Day13.md`

````markdown
# ⭐ OPIc Sample Answer - Day 13

Compared to the past, my daily life has become much busier.

When I was younger, I had more free time and spent a lot of time playing games or hanging out with my friends.

These days, I spend more time studying and planning for my future.

Compared to when I was younger, I also use my smartphone and computer much more often.

At first, I found this change a little stressful, but now I think it has helped me become more responsible and organized.
```

